  "release_notes": "Fix: the bottom of the window (alert sound and volume) could be cut off on 1920x1080 screens.\n\n- The window now sizes itself to fit your screen above the taskbar, including when Windows display scaling is set to 125% or 150%.\n- If space is tight, the Ready Messages list gives up room first, so the Ready button, Send to and sound controls always stay visible. The newest Ready stays at the bottom of the list.\n- Send to is more compact: smaller station buttons in a fixed-height box. Stations sit in one centered row, and move into two rows only when they don't fit.",
